{# Common Patterns #}
<section>
    <h2>Common Patterns Using Q Units</h2>

    <h3>Spacing Scale</h3>

    <p>Build consistent spacing by using multiples of q(8):</p>

    <div class="code-block">
        <pre><code>@use "unit.gl" as *;

$space-xs: q(4);   // 0.25rem
$space-sm: q(8);   // 0.5rem
$space-md: q(16);  // 1rem
$space-lg: q(24);  // 1.5rem
$space-xl: q(32);  // 2rem
$space-2xl: q(48); // 3rem

// Usage
.component {
  padding: $space-md;
  margin-bottom: $space-lg;
  gap: $space-sm;
}</code></pre>
    </div>

    <h3>Typography Scale</h3>

    <p>Use Q units for consistent typography:</p>

    <div class="code-block">
        <pre><code>body {
  font-size: q(14); // Base size
  line-height: q(24); // 1.7 ratio
}

h1 { font-size: q(32); line-height: q(40); }
h2 { font-size: q(24); line-height: q(32); }
h3 { font-size: q(20); line-height: q(28); }
h4 { font-size: q(16); line-height: q(24); }

caption { font-size: q(12); }</code></pre>
    </div>

    <h3>Border & Radius</h3>

    <p>Control visual elements precisely:</p>

    <div class="code-block">
        <pre><code>// Border widths
$border-thin: q(1);
$border-default: q(2);
$border-thick: q(3);

// Border radius
$radius-sm: q(2);   // Subtle
$radius-md: q(4);   // Default
$radius-lg: q(8);   // Rounded
$radius-pill: q(128); // Full rounded</code></pre>
    </div>
</section>
